---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

---
<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 300" role="img" aria-label="Two bars. Before the change the service's 99th percentile latency is about 48 milliseconds, drawn in red. After it is about 18 milliseconds. Below, the one-line diff of the guard: if missing_actions becomes if missing_actions and request.posteriors. The cost was a structured warning and four metric increments written inside every request.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>SoundCloud ad-decisioning service (Python): p99 before and after one line</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Service quyết định quảng cáo của SoundCloud (Python): p99 trước và sau một dòng</tspan></text>
    <text x="130" y="74" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>before</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trước</tspan></text>
    <rect x="140" y="56" width="432" height="26" class="rbar" />
    <text x="582" y="75" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>~48 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>~48 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="130" y="118" class="m" text-anchor="end"><tspan data-lang-en>after</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sau</tspan></text>
    <rect x="140" y="100" width="162" height="26" class="bar" />
    <text x="312" y="119" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>~18 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>~18 ms</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="log" x={52} y={184} size={24} />
    <text x="84" y="180" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>per request, for callers that send no posteriors: one structured warning</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi request của caller không gửi posteriors: một warning có cấu trúc</tspan></text>
    <text x="84" y="200" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>and four metric increments, written synchronously inside the request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và bốn lần tăng metric, ghi đồng bộ ngay trong request</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="224" width="640" height="56" class="box" />
    <text x="56" y="246" class="m mono"><tspan data-lang-en>- if missing_actions:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>- if missing_actions:</tspan></text>
    <text x="56" y="268" class="r mono"><tspan data-lang-en>+ if missing_actions and request.posteriors:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>+ if missing_actions and request.posteriors:</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Numbers and the diff are from SoundCloud's own write-up. The team's first guess was string formatting; the cost was the synchronous write of the log line.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số liệu và đoạn diff lấy từ bài viết của chính SoundCloud. Giả thuyết đầu của đội là format chuỗi; cái tốn thật là việc ghi dòng log đồng bộ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig11 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fig11 .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .fig11 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .fig11 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .fig11 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .fig11 .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig11 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .fig11 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .fig11 .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig11 .rbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .lead { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .fig11 .rline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .fig11 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .rbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .fig11 .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .fig11 .arrow-l { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 .rarrow { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .rarrow-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .fig11 .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
